Z||000000||iplayazi||06-03-2000||06:56 PM||||Does anybody know whats wrong with my signal lights when it doesnt work.. just comes on, doesnt flash. I replaced the fuse and the lights do come on, but I have to do it manually. please help! Peace!||||reg||1
